[I] Session manager for the COSMIC desktop environment

[T] cosmic-session is the session manager of System76's COSMIC desktop
[T] environment. It starts the compositor and the other core COSMIC
[T] components, such as panel, settings daemon and notifications, and
[T] supervises them for the duration of the session.

[U] https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-session/

[A] System76 <info@system76.com>
[M] NoTag <notag@t2sde.org>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 1.12.0

[CV-GROUP] cosmic-desktop
[D] 5d802f9c8edaa99eaa8b56355b34915431a8216a6f90bc05e92d2092 cosmic-session-epoch-1.12.0.tar.gz https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-session/archive/epoch-1.12.0/

. $base/package/cosmic/*/cosmic-conf.in

hook_add postmake 5 'cp -vf data/cosmic.desktop $root$datadir/xsessions/'
hook_add postmake 5 'cp -vf data/start-cosmic $root$bindir/'
